# Service level summary

For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened [[cite:obs-d5d953b163a76421b187eea09626498978eaf274 "For priority-1 incidents the response time is two (2) hours from the time the ticket is opened."]].

Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation [[cite:obs-b4faad701a85eb7893a6ab6b52ce927522ce279b "Priority-1 incidents are escalated to the on-call engineer through the pager rotation."]].
